WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.595
Roxy kept listening to the underground sounds.

2
00:00:04.596 --> 00:00:07.676
"I hear the ground shaking," she thought.

3
00:00:07.676 --> 00:00:11.919
"And something that sounds like a big machine underground.

4
00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.437
Plus those voices again.

5
00:00:14.438 --> 00:00:17.218
Where are they coming from?"

6
00:00:17.219 --> 00:00:20.820
Roxy looked at Detective Smith and the construction workers.

7
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:26.047
"Everyone, stand back!" she said.

8
00:00:26.048 --> 00:00:28.703
Roxy started to spin like a top.

9
00:00:28.703 --> 00:00:31.088
A hole formed under her feet.

10
00:00:31.089 --> 00:00:34.428
Pieces of blacktop flew everywhere.

11
00:00:34.429 --> 00:00:39.376
She went faster and faster, drilling into the ground at super speed.

12
00:00:39.377 --> 00:00:42.189
"Rocket Girl!" called Detective Smith.

13
00:00:42.189 --> 00:00:44.678
"What are you doing?"

14
00:00:44.678 --> 00:00:47.103
But Roxy didn't answer.

15
00:00:47.104 --> 00:00:50.413
She was already deep underground.

16
00:00:50.413 --> 00:00:54.603
Roxy arrived in a huge dark cave.

17
00:00:54.603 --> 00:00:59.959
"Look! A human!" shouted a voice over the loud rumble.

18
00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:06.501
Using her super vision to see in the dark, Roxy spotted several tiny men.

19
00:01:06.501 --> 00:01:10.712
They had mole-like faces and wore brown jumpsuits.

20
00:01:10.713 --> 00:01:13.517
The men stood next to a big machine.

21
00:01:13.518 --> 00:01:18.711
It looked like it was built out of truck parts and other construction equipment.

22
00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:22.292
"Who are you?" Roxy demanded.

23
00:01:22.292 --> 00:01:27.694
One of the men pulled a lever, and the machine stopped running.

24
00:01:27.694 --> 00:01:30.751
"We're the mole men!" he said.

25
00:01:30.751 --> 00:01:34.330
"And we're going to destroy Metro City!"

26
00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:38.888
Roxy gulped. "Why do you want to do that?"

27
00:01:38.889 --> 00:01:41.325
The mole man glared at Roxy.

28
00:01:41.325 --> 00:01:45.586
"We're sick of humans digging sewers and subways down here.

29
00:01:45.586 --> 00:01:48.964
The underground is for mole men only!"

30
00:01:48.964 --> 00:01:53.963
He looked at the other mole men. "Grab her!"

31
00:01:53.963 --> 00:01:57.980
Two mole men ran toward Roxy, swinging iron pipes at her.

32
00:01:57.981 --> 00:01:59.864
Roxy jumped out of the way.

33
00:01:59.865 --> 00:02:02.745
The mole men crashed into the cave wall.

34
00:02:02.745 --> 00:02:05.414
"Ouch!" one cried.

35
00:02:05.414 --> 00:02:09.431
Whap! The other one swung his pipe.

36
00:02:09.432 --> 00:02:12.099
"Ouch!" the first one cried again.

37
00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:14.230
"Oops!" said the other.

38
00:02:14.231 --> 00:02:16.696
The two mole men looked around.

39
00:02:16.696 --> 00:02:20.976
"Where did she go?" they asked.

40
00:02:20.976 --> 00:02:27.926
"These mole men don't see very well," Roxy thought. "Just like real moles!"

41
00:02:27.926 --> 00:02:33.502
"There she is!" One mole man pointed at Roxy. "Get her!"

42
00:02:33.502 --> 00:02:37.324
More mole men ran toward Roxy.

43
00:02:37.324 --> 00:02:42.559
"No humans underground!" shouted one mole man.

44
00:02:42.559 --> 00:02:47.991
"The underground is for mole men only!" shouted a second mole man.

45
00:02:47.991 --> 00:02:50.636
Again Roxy jumped out of the way.

46
00:02:50.636 --> 00:02:53.824
All the mole men bumped into one another.

47
00:02:53.824 --> 00:02:57.999
They tripped and crashed into the wall.

48
00:02:57.999 --> 00:03:02.211
One mole man was still near the earthquake machine.

49
00:03:02.211 --> 00:03:07.098
He pulled the lever, and the machine rumbled loudly.

50
00:03:07.098 --> 00:03:10.645
Zap! A ray shot from the machine.

51
00:03:10.645 --> 00:03:18.446
It blasted the ceiling of the cave, and big rocks crashed down onto Roxy!

